   "lastUpdatedAt": "2023-08-25T22:00:00.000Z",
   "relatedImpactInScope": "smart_contract"
  },
  {
   "description": "MixinReserve.claimableReserve() can produce per-claimant reserve caps above or below the fair R/N allocation when the live transcoder pool size and the current-round active set diverge mid-round (e.g. during resignation or activation). Overclaim is bounded by the ticket face value. No theft is possible.",
   "link": "https://github.com/livepeer/protocol/issues/656",
   "lastUpdatedAt": "2019-09-19T22:00:00.000Z",
